gantt
    title Aircraft Turnaround Critical Path (45-Minute Ground Stop)
    dateFormat  X
    axisFormat %s min

    section Pax Flow
    Chocks On & Jetbridge Connect :0, 2
    Passenger Deboarding          :2, 14
    Cabin Security & Cleaning     :14, 26
    Passenger Boarding            :26, 42
    Cabin Secure & Doors Closed   :42, 45

    section Baggage & Cargo
    Belt Loaders Positioned       :2, 4
    Inbound Baggage Offload       :4, 16
    Outbound Baggage Loading      :16, 36
    Cargo Holds Secured           :36, 40

    section Fuel & Servicing
    Fuel Truck Position & Ground  :5, 8
    Underwing Refueling           :8, 24
    Potable Water & Lavatory      :10, 22
    Catering Exchange             :14, 25

    section Departure Ready
    ATC Pushback Clearance        :42, 44
    Tug Hookup & Pushback         :44, 45
